        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are a leading global cruise company which operates the Norwegian Cruise Line, Oceania Cruises and Regent Seven Seas Cruises brands.",
        "start_character": 1170,
        "end_character": 1304
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-022067",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-022067-fd8ec256d840edd6",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-022067",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We developed Infectious Disease Management Protocols, which were certified and audited to DNV’s Certification in Infection Prevention, to further enhance our outbreak prevention and response to all types of infectious disease including, but not limited to COVID-19, norovirus, acute gastroenteritis, influenza and influenza-like illnesses.",
        "start_character": 42103,
        "end_character": 42442
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-022067",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-022067-fd8ec256d840edd6",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-022067",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We expect global tax reform will continue to evolve over the coming years, and we will continue to monitor any new developments and assess impacts to the Company.",
        "start_character": 59938,
        "end_character": 60100
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-022067",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-022067-fd8ec256d840edd6",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-022067",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We operate all our vessels to meet and exceed the requirements of SOLAS and International Management Code for the Safe Operation of Ships and for Pollution Prevention (“ISM Code”), the international safety standards which govern the cruise industry.",
        "start_character": 41605,
        "end_character": 41854
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-022067",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-022067-fd8ec256d840edd6",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-022067",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "By prioritizing crew wellness, we empower our staff to consistently deliver exceptional customer service, reflecting our ongoing commitment to both our employees and our customers.",
        "start_character": 60836,
        "end_character": 61016
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-022067",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-022067-fd8ec256d840edd6",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-022067",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "For information regarding risks associated with our compliance with legal and regulatory requirements, see “Item 1A—Risk Factors” in this Annual Report, including the risk factor titled “We are subject to complex laws and regulations, including environmental, health and safety, labor, data privacy and protection and maritime laws and regulations, which could adversely affect our operations and certain recently introduced laws and regulations and future changes in laws and regulations could lead to increased costs and/or decreased revenue.”",
        "start_character": 47024,
        "end_character": 47569
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-022067",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-022067-fd8ec256d840edd6",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-022067",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "The various tax regimes to which we are currently subject result in a relatively low effective tax rate on our worldwide income.",
        "start_character": 58561,
        "end_character": 58689
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-022067",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-022067-fd8ec256d840edd6",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-022067",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "Under such laws and regulations, we are prohibited from discharging certain materials, such as petrochemicals and plastics, into waterways, and we must adhere to various water and air quality-related requirements.",
